A build pipeline

A `Developer` pushes to `GitHub`, with the label `push`. `GitHub` starts `CI`,
with the label `start`. `CI` runs the `Tests`, with the label `run`, then sends
an image to the `Registry`, with the label `push image`. The `Deployer` pulls
from the `Registry`, with the label `pull`.
---
Developer -> GitHub: push
GitHub -> CI: start
CI -> Tests: run
CI -> Registry: push image
Deployer -> Registry: pull
